 "turns": [
  {
   "turn_id": "C60-D002",
   "turn_index": 0,
   "speaker": "ハサン",
   "source_text": "公民館は8人で12,000円。でも二人は時間が合いませんね。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C60-D002-S01",
    "C60-D002-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-techagent-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 0.0,
   "end_sec": 7.187,
   "duration_sec": 7.187
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C60-D003",
   "turn_index": 1,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "ええ。私も川西市在住ですが、緑町勤務なので資格はあります。二人も資格の問題ではありません。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C60-D003-S01",
    "C60-D003-S02",
    "C60-D003-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": true,
   "review_flags": [
    "clip_asr_difference",
    "low_ASR_text_match"
   ],
   "start_sec": 7.537,
   "end_sec": 15.597,
   "duration_sec": 8.06
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C60-D008",
   "turn_index": 2,
   "speaker": "ハサン",
   "source_text": "オンラインの特典は確認中ですね。なければ予算を2,000円超えます。私は会社に支払いの許可を聞きます。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C60-D008-S01",
    "C60-D008-S02",
    "C60-D008-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-techagent-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 15.947,
   "end_sec": 23.527,
   "duration_sec": 7.58
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C60-D009",
   "turn_index": 3,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "私が初回資格を確認します。質問はともかく、優先順位は全員が続けられること、次に予算です。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C60-D009-S01",
    "C60-D009-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 23.877,
   "end_sec": 32.462,
   "duration_sec": 8.585
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C60-D010",
   "turn_index": 4,
   "speaker": "ハサン",
   "source_text": "大野さんは直接聞ける講座に限ると言っていました。オンラインが無理なら、どうしますか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C60-D010-S01",
    "C60-D010-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-techagent-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 32.812,
   "end_sec": 39.592,
   "duration_sec": 6.78
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C60-D011",
   "turn_index": 5,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "6人で公民館なら9,000円。二人が図書館を使い、教材を二冊追加しても総額10,000円です。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C60-D011-S01",
    "C60-D011-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 39.942,
   "end_sec": 47.645,
   "duration_sec": 7.703
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C60-D016",
   "turn_index": 6,
   "speaker": "ハサン",
   "source_text": "6,000円残りますね。ただ、二人の同意なしには決められません。教材の供給は大丈夫ですか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C60-D016-S01",
    "C60-D016-S02",
    "C60-D016-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-techagent-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 47.995,
   "end_sec": 54.599,
   "duration_sec": 6.604
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C60-D017",
   "turn_index": 7,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "在庫も私が聞きます。なければ別の本を使えるか二人と相談します。14日までに確認して全員に連絡します。まだ申し込みません。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C60-D017-S01",
    "C60-D017-S02",
    "C60-D017-S03",
    "C60-D017-S04"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 54.949,
   "end_sec": 65.415,
   "duration_sec": 10.466
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C60-D101",
   "turn_index": 8,
   "speaker": "ハサン",
   "source_text": "別件ですが、衣料室の体験会用の小物は購入しますか。予算は別ですね。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C60-D101-S01",
    "C60-D101-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-techagent-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 66.315,
   "end_sec": 72.592,
   "duration_sec": 6.277
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C60-D102",
   "turn_index": 9,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "はい。個人の家計から出すので、懐具合を考えて一人分1,000円までです。住宅ローンもあり、あり金を使う余裕はありません。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C60-D102-S01",
    "C60-D102-S02",
    "C60-D102-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 72.942,
   "end_sec": 83.393,
   "duration_sec": 10.451
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C60-D103",
   "turn_index": 10,
   "speaker": "ハサン",
   "source_text": "駅前の露店に物産展の品が並んでいました。大安売りと書いてありますが、特売の価格は消費税抜きです。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C60-D103-S01",
    "C60-D103-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-techagent-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 83.743,
   "end_sec": 90.997,
   "duration_sec": 7.254
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C60-D104",
   "turn_index": 11,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "値引き後の金額に税を含めるんですね。代金の支払いに商品券は使えますか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C60-D104-S01",
    "C60-D104-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 91.347,
   "end_sec": 97.328,
   "duration_sec": 5.981
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C60-D105",
   "turn_index": 12,
   "speaker": "ハサン",
   "source_text": "店で聞きましょう。見たのは銀色のメタリックアクセサリーで、銀製ではありません。金属製でも材料は違います。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C60-D105-S01",
    "C60-D105-S02",
    "C60-D105-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-techagent-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 97.678,
   "end_sec": 105.62,
   "duration_sec": 7.942
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C60-D106",
   "turn_index": 13,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "銅の輪を使ったネックレスですか。私は金色よりその色が好きです。でもピアスは穴を開けていないので使えません。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C60-D106-S01",
    "C60-D106-S02",
    "C60-D106-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 105.97,
   "end_sec": 114.609,
   "duration_sec": 8.639
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C60-D107",
   "turn_index": 14,
   "speaker": "ハサン",
   "source_text": "それなら、耳に穴がなくても使えるネックレスを借りるほうが得かもしれません。毎回買うと出費も馬鹿にならないし、飾りを求めたらきりがないです。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C60-D107-S01",
    "C60-D107-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-techagent-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 114.959,
   "end_sec": 125.968,
   "duration_sec": 11.009
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C60-D108",
   "turn_index": 15,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "そうですね。特別な優待より再利用を考えます。贅沢な物は二の次です。安さにつられてよけいに買えば損ですから。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C60-D108-S01",
    "C60-D108-S02",
    "C60-D108-S03",
    "C60-D108-S04"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 126.318,
   "end_sec": 135.532,
   "duration_sec": 9.214
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C60-D109",
   "turn_index": 16,
   "speaker": "ハサン",
   "source_text": "では、借りられるだけ借りて、不足分だけ買いましょう。選ぶ時間はたっぷりあります。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C60-D109-S01",
    "C60-D109-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-techagent-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 135.882,
   "end_sec": 141.493,
   "duration_sec": 5.611
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C60-D110",
   "turn_index": 17,
   "speaker": "ハサン",
   "source_text": "勘定は小銭で払いたいので、札しか使えないと困ります。百円玉も使えるか聞きますね。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C60-D110-S01",
    "C60-D110-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-techagent-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 141.843,
   "end_sec": 149.576,
   "duration_sec": 7.733
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C60-D111",
   "turn_index": 18,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "お願いします。交通カードなら残高を見てからチャージします。買えるだけ買うのではなく、必要な物を決めておきたいです。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C60-D111-S01",
    "C60-D111-S02",
    "C60-D111-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 149.926,
   "end_sec": 158.066,
   "duration_sec": 8.14
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C60-D112",
   "turn_index": 19,
   "speaker": "ハサン",
   "source_text": "経済的な事情は人によって違いますしね。準備に時間を費やすばかりか、小物の代金が生活費にまで食い込んでは困ります。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C60-D112-S01",
    "C60-D112-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-techagent-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 158.416,
   "end_sec": 167.412,
   "duration_sec": 8.996
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C60-D113",
   "turn_index": 20,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "はい。借金なしで参加できることが大事です。見栄のためにお金を使うのはやめましょう。二人とも、持っている物を先に調べましょう。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C60-D113-S01",
    "C60-D113-S02",
    "C60-D113-S03",
    "C60-D113-S04"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 167.762,
   "end_sec": 177.552,
   "duration_sec": 9.79
  }
 ],
